    "duration": 3,
    "text": "警方查緝的災台嫌犯不少有幫派背景"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 273,
    "start": 989,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "涉嫌替柬埔寨詐團做事"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 274,
    "start": 991,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "雜種金租下飯店場地招募大量零眼"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 275,
    "start": 994,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "把架的投資老師見面會"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 276,
    "start": 996,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "打造的有模有樣"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 277,
    "start": 997,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "每次花費動輒近百萬"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 278,
    "start": 999,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "全程拍片記錄上傳群組"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 279,
    "start": 1002,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "背後目的只有一個"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 280,
    "start": 1003,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "讓被害人在投資騙局越陷越深"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 281,
    "start": 1006,
    "duration": 15,
    "text": "翻開群組對話裡頭提到的吳教授"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 282,
    "start": 1021,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "也是冒名使用"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 283,
    "start": 1022,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "嫌犯透過AI換臉"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 284,
    "start": 1024,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "將講者長相換成台金院董事長吳忠書"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 285,
    "start": 1027,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "或是知名企業家胡國林等專家學者"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 286,
    "start": 1031,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "依假亂增提高可信度"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 287,
    "start": 1033,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不到一年就有18人受害"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 288,
    "start": 1035,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "詐得超過1.2億元"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 289,
    "start": 1037,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "警方更不排除害人輕生"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 290,
    "start": 1039,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "家屬曾悲痛相宴"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 291,
    "start": 1042,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "就在去年12月"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 292,
    "start": 1044,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "台北市內湖一對母女爆出受騙前晚"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 293,
    "start": 1047,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "最終走上絕路"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 294,
    "start": 1048,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "案經刑事局調查"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 295,
    "start": 1050,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "懷疑死者與全案有高度關聯"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 296,
    "start": 1052,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "但這次落網的17人所有部分已被起訴"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 297,
    "start": 1056,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "卻只有一人又被擠壓"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 298,
    "start": 1058,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "共識新聞陳環勳陳虹益臺北報導"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 299,
    "start": 1061,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "2023年底"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 300,
    "start": 1064,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "新北市某國中"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 301,
    "start": 1066,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "發生震驚社會的割井案之後"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 302,
    "start": 1070,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "教育部宣示"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 303,
    "start": 1072,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "增加設置中小學學務校安人力"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 304,
    "start": 1077,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而一年多過去"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 305,
    "start": 1079,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "教育部在114學年補助地方辦理"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 306,
    "start": 1083,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "國中增加設置學務人力"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 307,
    "start": 1086,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "或設置副組長"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 308,
    "start": 1088,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "遭到教團批評慢板拍"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 309,
    "start": 1092,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "不過有國中校長直言"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 310,
    "start": 1094,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "現在的教學現場具有相當的挑戰度"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 311,
    "start": 1098,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "樂見人力盡來幫忙"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 312,
    "start": 1115,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "老師規勸中學女學生"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 313,
    "start": 1117,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "早點回家遭到回罪辱罵"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 314,
    "start": 1119,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "這段由另一名學生所拍的影片"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 315,
    "start": 1122,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "近日在網路轉傳"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 316,
    "start": 1124,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "當時學校表示"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 317,
    "start": 1125,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "事情發生在9月1號開學日"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 318,
    "start": 1127,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "因下午沒課"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 319,
    "start": 1128,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "老師勸學生快回家"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 320,
    "start": 1130,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "而校方一發現影片"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 321,
    "start": 1132,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "主動關心當事老師"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 322,
    "start": 1133,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "通知家長和學生到校"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 323,
    "start": 1135,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "完成校安通報並開會處理"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 324,
    "start": 1138,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "單一的然後偶發的"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 325,
    "start": 1140,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "一個不服管教的事情"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 326,
    "start": 1142,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "那通知家長來"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 327,
    "start": 1144,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "家長也非常支持導師的部分"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 328,
    "start": 1146,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "然後所以學生寫了悔過書"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 329,
    "start": 1149,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "向老師道歉"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 330,
    "start": 1150,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "然後呢"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 331,
    "start": 1151,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "那老師也知道真實的狀況"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 332,
    "start": 1153,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "也願意原諒學生"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 333,
    "start": 1155,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "學生向老師道歉"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 334,
    "start": 1157,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "老師也選擇原諒不願申救"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 335,
    "start": 1159,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但對不少老師來說"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 336,
    "start": 1161,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "近年來教育現場暴力霸凌"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 337,
    "start": 1163,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "層出不窮"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 338,
    "start": 1164,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "受害者不限學生"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 339,
    "start": 1166,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "自己也自身難保"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 340,
    "start": 1168,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這個東西在網路上一發酵"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 341,
    "start": 1170,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "學生會學啊"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 342,
    "start": 1172,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "那老師的部分可能面對這樣的一個狀況"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 343,
    "start": 1174,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "他會更退縮"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 344,
    "start": 1175,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "輔導管教是難題"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 345,
    "start": 1177,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "面對校園衝突或學生高風險行為"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 346,
    "start": 1179,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "老師更需學務和校安人力"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 347,
    "start": 1182,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "能在第一時間介入處理"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 348,
    "start": 1184,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "教育部表示"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 349,
    "start": 1185,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一百一十四學年度核定一點二億"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 350,
    "start": 1188,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "補助地方辦理國中增至學務人力或設置副組長"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 351,
    "start": 1192,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "副組長補助方案三十班一人"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 352,
    "start": 1194,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "三十一到六十班兩人"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 353,
    "start": 1196,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "六十一班以上三人"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 354,
    "start": 1198,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "目前有七縣市提申請"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 355,
    "start": 1200,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "在新北市目前多數國中"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 356,
    "start": 1202,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "是申請增至學務人力"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 357,
    "start": 1204,
    "duration": 15,
    "text": "國中校長說"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 358,
    "start": 1219,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "新的學務人力非教育專業"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 359,
    "start": 1221,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "將協助提升相關職能"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 360,
    "start": 1223,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "雖然剛開學無法看到很大效益"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 361,
    "start": 1226,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但能多一個人幫忙都是好事"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 362,
    "start": 1228,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "只是也有校長私下表示"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 363,
    "start": 1230,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "這是非常態性補助"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 364,
    "start": 1232,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "加上才華法修法後的不確定性"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 365,
    "start": 1235,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "擔心很難補足關鍵的校安人力"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 366,
    "start": 1238,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "共識新聞林曉慧 溫正恆 沈志明 台北報導"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 367,
    "start": 1258,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "迎進澳洲心理健康急救計畫"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 368,
    "start": 1262,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "希望訓練人人都能夠成為"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 369,
    "start": 1265,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "心理健康急救員"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 370,
    "start": 1268,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "一旦周遭發現有人的"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 371,
    "start": 1270,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "心理健康出現狀況"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 372,
    "start": 1272,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "可以早期發現並及時給予幫助"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 373,
    "start": 1275,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "不只身體急症"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 374,
    "start": 1280,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "需要CPR"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 375,
    "start": 1281,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "如果心理發生危機"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 376,
    "start": 1282,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "其實也需要救援之道"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 377,
    "start": 1284,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "現代人生活步調緊湊壓力大"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 378,
    "start": 1286,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "國人近年心理健康警訊不斷"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 379,
    "start": 1288,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "華人心理治療研究發展基金會"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 380,
    "start": 1291,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "在衛福部的支持下"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 381,
    "start": 1293,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "引進澳洲心理健康急救計畫"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 382,
    "start": 1295,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "希望訓練人人成為"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 383,
    "start": 1297,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "心理健康急救員"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 384,
    "start": 1298,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "次日將推出第一個正式課程"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 385,
    "start": 1301,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "他開始出現了一些徵兆的時候"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 386,
    "start": 1304,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "有點不對勁的時候"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 387,
    "start": 1306,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "其實就希望你能夠去介入的去幫助他"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 388,
    "start": 1309,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "那以免他的情況惡化"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 389,
    "start": 1311,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "所以是一個早期介入的一個方案"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 390,
    "start": 1314,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "十五到二十四歲"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 391,
    "start": 1316,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "在過去十年當中"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 392,
    "start": 1317,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "自殺率有明顯的這個增加"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 393,
    "start": 1320,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "焦慮跟憂鬱症為主的這個情形"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 394,
    "start": 1323,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "可能每五個人當中就有一個"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 395,
    "start": 1326,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "有這個常見精神疾患的情況"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 396,
    "start": 1329,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "近年自殺重返國人十大死因"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 397,
    "start": 1332,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "國內約有五分之一的成年人"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 398,
    "start": 1334,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "可能患有常見的精神疾病"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 399,
    "start": 1336,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "傾聽給鼓勵是心理健康急救計畫的"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 400,
    "start": 1339,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "五個關鍵救援行動"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 401,
    "start": 1341,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "衛福部年底前"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 402,
    "start": 1342,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "總計將調訊近兩百名人員"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 403,
    "start": 1344,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "成為心理健康急救援"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 404,
    "start": 1346,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "因為在很多時候"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 405,
    "start": 1348,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "我們會急於給予幫助或協助"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 406,
    "start": 1351,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "但沒有即時的聽取"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 407,
    "start": 1353,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "就是對方想要表達"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 408,
    "start": 1355,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "或他們的心理狀況"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 409,
    "start": 1357,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "所以在這堂課中"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 410,
    "start": 1358,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "我學習到最大就是"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 411,
    "start": 1360,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "先去聽他們想要需要的協助"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 412,
    "start": 1363,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "跟他們的心理狀況"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 413,
    "start": 1365,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "目前全台已經有"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 414,
    "start": 1366,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "61處社區心理衛生中心"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 415,
    "start": 1368,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "年底將增加到71處"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 416,
    "start": 1370,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "並在2028年前完成100處佈建"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 417,
    "start": 1373,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "扮演社區守門員角色"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 418,
    "start": 1375,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "國視新聞黃曼辰不遇"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 419,
    "start": 1377,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "台北報導"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 420,
    "start": 1378,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "極端氣候帶來高溫"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 421,
    "start": 1382,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "小朋友常去玩耍的公園遊戲場"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 422,
    "start": 1385,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "也可能是高溫殺手"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 423,
    "start": 1388,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "溜滑梯等遊具燙到不能玩"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 424,
    "start": 1392,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "有環保團體實測"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 425,
    "start": 1394,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "有些人工草皮"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 426,
    "start": 1396,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "在曝曬下"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 427,
    "start": 1397,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "竟然高達攝氏80.1度"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 428,
    "start": 1401,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "呼籲政府應該要提出具體對策"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 429,
    "start": 1405,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "下午3點多的公園遊戲場"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 430,
    "start": 1409,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "沒有太多人"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 431,
    "start": 1410,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "一對母子全縮在礫石坑角落"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 432,
    "start": 1413,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "那邊剛好有一處陰影可以躲太陽"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 433,
    "start": 1416,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "今天孩子午睡提早醒來"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 434,
    "start": 1418,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "吵著要來"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 435,
    "start": 1419,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "來了卻熱到滿身大汗"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 436,
    "start": 1421,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "可以玩就好了"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 437,
    "start": 1427,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "媽媽說其實平日都下午5點才敢出門"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 438,
    "start": 1430,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "今天提早來結果溜滑梯燙到不能玩"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 439,
    "start": 1434,
    "duration": 11,
    "text": "高溫曝曬有多恐怖呢"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 440,
    "start": 1445,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "學者指出美澳都有研究"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 441,
    "start": 1447,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "在太陽曝曬後"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 442,
    "start": 1448,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "遊戲設施材質包括橡膠人工草皮"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 443,
    "start": 1451,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "高溫都可飆破80度C"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 444,
    "start": 1457,
    "duration": 11,
    "text": "環團綠色和平也曾在6月底以紅外線熱象儀"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 445,
    "start": 1468,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "實測台南仁安公園"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 446,
    "start": 1470,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "結果沙坑來到57.6度C"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 447,
    "start": 1472,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "人工草皮更高達80.1度"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 448,
    "start": 1475,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "曾實測超過20個公園的學者指出"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 449,
    "start": 1478,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "問題出在不是沒有遮蔭"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 450,
    "start": 1480,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "就是遮蔭變成裝飾而已"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 451,
    "start": 1487,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "其實都可以達到良好的舒適環境"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 452,
    "start": 1491,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "國內兒童遊戲場"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 453,
    "start": 1493,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "目前有衛福部的安全工作執行"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 454,
    "start": 1495,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "或地方政府的工作手冊"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 455,
    "start": 1497,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "但對於遮蔭規範都不明確"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 456,
    "start": 1500,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "要確保兒童的遊戲權"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 457,
    "start": 1502,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "學者建議公園遮蔭應該列為最高優先事項"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 458,
    "start": 1506,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "並且要遮到關鍵遮對地方遮得有效果"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 459,
    "start": 1510,
    "duration": 3,
    "text": "公視新聞臺北報導"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 460,
    "start": 1514,
    "duration": 5,
    "text": "關心天氣 積極提供您各地的氣象資料"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 461,
    "start": 1544,
    "duration": 10,
    "text": "請不吝點贊訂閱轉發打賞支持明鏡與點點欄目"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 462,
    "start": 1575,
    "duration": 4,
    "text": "感謝您收看這一節的公視手語新聞"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 463,
    "start": 1579,
    "duration": 1,
    "text": "我是王小樞"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 464,
    "start": 1580,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "明天同一時間再會"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 465,
    "start": 1604,
    "duration": 16,
    "text": "MING PAO CANADA | MING PAO TORONTO"
  }
]